# work-item-section-diff.sh golden index.
# Per-case fixture content (local.md/remote.md/expected.txt) lives under
# test-fixtures/work-item-section-diff/case-*/ — see Phase 1 of the 0170
# implementation plan for why this script needs the richer per-case-
# directory format rather than the touch-only <setup>|<args>|<expected>
# reader.
#
# Cases: case-frontmatter-only, case-preamble,
# case-named-heading-and-one-sided (also covers the byte-identical
# omitted-section behaviour), case-no-diff-after-normalisation,
# case-frontmatter-only-last-updated (the un-stripped IGNORE_KEYS quirk).
#
# The script's only two error paths (missing-argument and non-file-
# argument, both exit 2) need no file fixtures:
[USAGE_ERRORS]
missing-argument|2|Usage: work-item-section-diff.sh <local-file> <remote-file>
non-file-argument|2|work-item-section-diff.sh: both arguments must be files
